---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
const origin=Astro.site!;
const structuredData=[{'@type':'Service',name:'Wedding band bookings',serviceType:'Live wedding band',provider:{'@id':new URL('/#band',origin).href},areaServed:{'@type':'Country',name:'Ireland'},url:new URL('/wedding-band/',origin).href}, {'@type':'BreadcrumbList',itemListElement:[{'@type':'ListItem',position:1,name:'Home',item:new URL('/',origin).href},{'@type':'ListItem',position:2,name:'Wedding band',item:new URL('/wedding-band/',origin).href}]}];
---
<Layout title="Wedding Band Kerry & Ireland | Buachailli Dana" description="Book Kerry-based wedding band Buachailli Dana across Ireland. Professional two- to five-piece lineups, tailored setlists and competitive pricing." structuredData={structuredData}>
<main id="main"><section class="section press-heading"><a class="text-link" href="/">← Band &amp; solo bookings</a><span class="eyebrow">BUACHAILLI DANA</span><h1>WEDDING BAND<br /><em>in Kerry.</em></h1><p class="press-lead">Based in Kerry. Available for weddings throughout Ireland.</p></section><section class="section service-page"><div><h2>LIVE MUSIC<br /><em>for your wedding.</em></h2><p>Buachailli Dana is a Kerry-based wedding band offering two-, three-, four- and five-piece lineups. We travel throughout Ireland, with the lineup chosen around your venue and requirements.</p><p>Our professional musicians offer extremely competitive pricing, with a setlist catered to the venue and occasion. Whether you’re planning your wedding celebration or a day-two gathering, get in touch to discuss the music.</p><a class="pill wine" href="/#contact" data-service-format="band">Check wedding availability ↗</a></div><div class="service-details"><h3>Choosing your band lineup</h3><p>Tell us where the wedding is taking place, your preferred performance times and which band size you have in mind. If you’re unsure whether a two-, three-, four- or five-piece is right for the event, include your requirements and we can discuss the options.</p><h3>Wedding songs and requests</h3><p>Browse our <a class="inline-link" href="/setlist/">draft wedding setlist</a> for song ideas, from first-dance favourites to pop, rock, country and Irish music. Please confirm specific songs when booking, and let us know what you’d particularly like to hear.</p><h3>Day-two wedding music</h3><p>Band and <a class="inline-link" href="/solo-musician/">solo music bookings</a> are available for day twos as well as the wedding itself. Include your venue, date and preferred format in your enquiry.</p><h3>Hear us before enquiring</h3><p>Our <a class="inline-link" href="/live/">public live dates</a> include performances in Cork city, Dingle and Tralee. Check the listed venue and lineup before making plans to attend.</p><h3>Wedding band quotes</h3><p>For pricing and availability, contact <a class="inline-link" href={'mailto:'+site.email}>{site.email}</a> or call <a class="inline-link" href={'tel:'+site.phoneLink}>{site.phone}</a>. Include your date, venue and preferred lineup so we can discuss the right booking for your event.</p></div></section></main>
</Layout>
